AICE-javítás a storytold/deckcraft v0.5.0 webes (WASM) buildjéhez — csak target_arch = "wasm32",
a natív build változatlan:

AICE-CHANGE: the About dialog and the start screen have no Discord/website/GitHub links, and the Record tab has no "Learn More" (app page) button;
AICE-CHANGE: the web build embeds Carlito and Caladea (all styles, from the pinned craft-fonts), the metric-compatible stand-ins for Calibri and Cambria, so decks lay out in the browser as on the server.

Alkalmazás:  git -C <deckcraft> apply 0001-aice-branding.patch   (vagy: patch -d <deckcraft> -p1)

diff -ruN -x target -x dist -x '*.ttf' -x '*.orig' deckcraft.orig/crates/fonts/build.rs deckcraft/crates/fonts/build.rs
--- deckcraft.orig/crates/fonts/build.rs
+++ deckcraft/crates/fonts/build.rs
@@ -57,7 +57,13 @@
         if EXCLUDED_FAMILIES.contains(family) {
             continue;
         }
-        if wasm && !matches!((*family, *style), ("BIZ UDPGothic", "Regular") | ("Inter", "Regular" | "Bold" | "Variable")) {
+        // AICE: the web build also embeds Carlito and Caladea (all four styles), the metric-compatible
+        // stand-ins for Calibri and Cambria (`fontdb::substitutes`), so PowerPoint decks lay out
+        // in the browser as they do on the server.
+        if wasm
+            && !matches!((*family, *style), ("BIZ UDPGothic", "Regular") | ("Inter", "Regular" | "Bold" | "Variable"))
+            && !matches!(*family, "Carlito" | "Caladea")
+        {
             continue;
         }
         let path = dir.join(file).canonicalize().map_err(|e| format!("{file}: {e}"))?;
